  "help.heading": "ElasticBreath Guide",
  "help.body": "1. The app follows a state machine: Idle -> Working -> Resting / Paused.\n2. Edge feedback increases with pressure but never blocks your center view.\n3. Corner trigger requires hover; after trigger, you must leave the corner to trigger again.\n4. During rest overtime, edge inset width grows progressively until the configured max.\n5. Session lock/user switch is treated as away; restore follows return detection.\n6. All UI text supports Chinese and English via runtime JSON i18n.",
